      ],
      "content": "BOX LANE 1. 5252                                              (East Side)                                              Box Lane Court TL 00 NW 10/123 II 2. C18 and C19.  2 storeys in 2 heights.  Whitewashed brick, old tiled roofs.  Projecting left central block, plinth, 1st floor bands.  1:5:2 sash windows with glazing bars.  Main block architrave surrounds, 2 box dormers, frieze, cornice and parapet. 6 panelled door, 2 panels glazed, oblong fanlight with geometrical glazing bars; reveal, architrave surround, cornice on consoles. Listing NGR: TL0371805644"
    }
